543 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 313 0 R
/E (We aimed to build a complete journaling experience where users can submit entries and have them processed through AI sentiment analysis. This included displaying sentiment results along with confidence scores, while ensuring a smooth user experience through proper input validation, submission confirmation, error handling, and automatic input reset. Additionally, we planned to allow users to view their previous journal entries \(US13\).)
